"v1" begin="00:41.280" end="00:43.080"><span begin="00:41.280" end="00:41.430">I'm </span><span begin="00:41.430" end="00:41.640">no </span><span begin="00:41.640" end="00:42.060">liar</span><span begin="00:42.060" end="00:42.060">, </span><span begin="00:42.060" end="00:42.180">she </span><span begin="00:42.180" end="00:42.450">burn </span><span begin="00:42.450" end="00:42.540">up </span><span begin="00:42.540" end="00:42.600">the </span><span begin="00:42.600" end="00:43.080">spot</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:43.140" end="00:44.940"><span begin="00:43.140" end="00:43.320">Look </span><span begin="00:43.320" end="00:43.500">like </span><span begin="00:43.500" end="00:44.070">Mariah</span><span begin="00:44.070" end="00:44.070">, </span><span begin="00:44.070" end="00:44.100">I </span><span begin="00:44.100" end="00:44.280">took </span><span begin="00:44.280" end="00:44.550">another </span><span begin="00:44.550" end="00:44.940">shot</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:44.940" end="00:47.430"><span begin="00:44.940" end="00:45.420">Told </span><span begin="00:45.420" end="00:45.510">her </span><span begin="00:45.510" end="00:45.870">drop</span><span begin="00:45.870" end="00:45.870">, </span><span begin="00:45.870" end="00:46.230">drop</span><span begin="00:46.230" end="00:46.230">, </span><span begin="00:46.230" end="00:46.530">drop</span><span begin="00:46.530" end="00:46.530">, </span><span begin="00:46.530" end="00:46.740">drop </span><span begin="00:46.740" end="00:46.830">it </span><span begin="00:46.830" end="00:46.980">like </span><span begin="00:46.980" end="00:47.100">it's </span><span begin="00:47.100" end="00:47.430">hot</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:47.460" end="00:49.170"><span begin="00:47.460" end="00:47.820">Dirty </span><span begin="00:47.820" end="00:48.390">talk</span><span begin="00:48.390" end="00:48.420">, </span><span begin="00:48.420" end="00:48.810">dirty </span><span begin="00:48.810" end="00:49.170">dance</span></p><p 